<title>FRANCE: CYCLING-STEPHENS WINS 17TH STAGE OF TOUR DE FRANCE.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-STEPHENS WINS 17TH STAGE OF TOUR DE FRANCE.</headline>
<dateline>COLMAR, France 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Neil Stephens of Australia won the 17th stage of the Tour de France over 218.5 kms from Fribourg in Switzerland on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Jan Ullrich of Germany retained the overall leader's yellow jersey.</p>
</text>
